<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Skoda says approves equity expansion.</title>
<headline>Czech Skoda says approves equity expansion.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech engineering concern Skoda said its shareholders approved an equity expansion of up to 2.5 billion crowns at an extraordinary general meeting on Friday to cover the firm's investment needs.</p>
<p>Skoda spokesman Karel Samec told Reuters that Skoda's current shareholders would have the right of first refusal for the offering.</p>
</text>
